  "id": "interpretation",
  "term": "interpretation",
  "definition": "In this biological context, interpretation means making sense of TMS-EEG results by linking different measures to cortical reactivity, network dynamics, and oscillatory activity. It also involves judging findings in light of factors that can complicate meaning, such as artifacts, individual differences, baseline brain state, and limited standardization across studies.",
